abstract: >
  DATASET_MULTIMODAL_V8 is a nationwide municipal-level
  multimodal dataset for dengue surveillance, nowcasting
  and forecasting in Brazil covering the period 2010–2025.
  The dataset integrates epidemiological, meteorological,
  precipitation, remote sensing, ENSO, topographic,
  land-cover, demographic and sanitation information.

